# Approval

- **GUI** Normal / Personalised / Missing Logo batch into Output/RAR: do not run against live data unless the supervisor already said **yes / do it / fill / run**. Confirm mode and folders when unclear.
- **Shared Inbox auto Missing Logo** (`auto_missing_logo_watcher`): **no approval** by design. Uses folders from `queue_app_settings.json`. Re-runs generate new timestamped PNGs.
